{"seq":2,"slug":"css-transitions-animations","title":"CSS 过渡与动画：transition、@keyframes 与 @property","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/foundations/css-transitions-animations","wordCount":1094,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"css-过渡与动画-transition-keyframes-与-property\">CSS 过渡与动画：transition、@keyframes 与 @property</h1><p>CSS 动画系统是 Web 动画的声明式基础。从简单的悬停过渡到复杂的关键帧序列，再到通过 <code>@property</code> 为自定义属性赋予过渡能力——CSS 动画的能力边界比大多数工程师认知的更宽。本文系统梳理这套系统的每个组成部分及其工程细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"css-transition-声明式过渡\">CSS transition：声明式过渡</h2><p><code>transition</code> 属性在 CSS 属性值变化时自动补间，是最简单的动画方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".button {&#10;  background-color: #3b82f6;&#10;  transform: scale(1);&#10;  /* 声明哪些属性需要过渡，以及过渡参数 */&#10;  transition:&#10;    background-color 0.2s ease,&#10;    transform 0.15s ease-out;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.button:hover {&#10;  background-color: #2563eb;&#10;  transform: scale(1.05);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background-color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">#3b82f6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 声明哪些属性需要过渡，以及过渡参数 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    background-color </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transform </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease-out</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.button:hover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background-color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">#2563eb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"transition-属性详解\">transition 属性详解</h3><p><code>transition</code> 是以下四个子属性的简写：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子属性</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>transition-property</code></td>\n<td>要过渡的 CSS 属性名</td>\n<td><code>all</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transition-duration</code></td>\n<td>过渡持续时间</td>\n<td><code>0s</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transition-timing-function</code></td>\n<td>缓动函数</td>\n<td><code>ease</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transition-delay</code></td>\n<td>过渡延迟时间</td>\n<td><code>0s</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong><code>transition-property: all</code> 的性能风险</strong>：<code>all</code> 会监听所有属性变化，包括会触发 Layout 的属性。显式指定属性名是最佳实践：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 推荐 */&#10;transition:&#10;  transform 0.3s ease,&#10;  opacity 0.3s ease;&#10;&#10;/* 避免 */&#10;transition: all 0.3s ease;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 推荐 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">transition:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  transform 0</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.3s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ease,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opacity 0</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.3s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ease;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 避免 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">transition: all 0</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.3s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ease;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"缓动函数系统\">缓动函数系统</h3><p>缓动函数（timing function）描述动画的速度曲线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[缓动函数类型] --&gt; B[&quot;cubic-bezier(x1,y1,x2,y2)&lt;br/&gt;贝塞尔曲线&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;steps(n, direction)&lt;br/&gt;步进函数&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;linear()&lt;br/&gt;分段线性 CSS Level 5&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;ease / ease-in / ease-out&lt;br/&gt;ease-in-out 均为预设&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[缓动函数类型] --&gt; B[\"cubic-bezier(x1,y1,x2,y2)&lt;br/&gt;贝塞尔曲线\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"steps(n, direction)&lt;br/&gt;步进函数\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"linear()&lt;br/&gt;分段线性 CSS Level 5\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"ease / ease-in / ease-out&lt;br/&gt;ease-in-out 均为预设\"]</pre><p>常用缓动函数的贝塞尔曲线值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关键字</th>\n<th>等效贝塞尔值</th>\n<th>典型使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ease</code></td>\n<td><code>cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.1, 0.25, 1)</code></td>\n<td>通用默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ease-out</code></td>\n<td><code>cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.58, 1)</code></td>\n<td>元素进场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ease-in</code></td>\n<td><code>cubic-bezier(0.42, 0, 1, 1)</code></td>\n<td>元素退场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ease-in-out</code></td>\n<td><code>cubic-bezier(0.42, 0, 0.58, 1)</code></td>\n<td>往返动画</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>linear</code></td>\n<td><code>cubic-bezier(0, 0, 1, 1)</code></td>\n<td>匀速滚动指示器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Material Design 推荐的缓动</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>标准曲线（Standard）：<code>cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)</code> — 进出均减速</li>\n<li>减速曲线（Decelerate）：<code>cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0, 1)</code> — 元素进场</li>\n<li>加速曲线（Accelerate）：<code>cubic-bezier(0.3, 0, 1, 1)</code> — 元素退场</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>步进函数</strong>用于精灵图动画或分阶段状态变化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 8 帧精灵图动画 */&#10;.sprite {&#10;  width: 64px;&#10;  animation: run 0.8s steps(8) infinite;&#10;}&#10;&#10;@keyframes run {&#10;  from {&#10;    background-position: 0 0;&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    background-position: -512px 0;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 8 帧精灵图动画 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.sprite</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: run </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">infinite</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    background-position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    background-position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-512</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"keyframes-关键帧动画\">@keyframes：关键帧动画</h2><p><code>@keyframes</code> 定义动画序列，<code>animation</code> 属性将其应用到元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@keyframes slide-in {&#10;  from {&#10;    opacity: 0;&#10;    transform: translateY(-20px);&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    opacity: 1;&#10;    transform: translateY(0);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;.notification {&#10;  animation: slide-in 0.3s ease-out forwards;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> slide-in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-20</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.notification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: slide-in </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease-out</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> forwards</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"animation-属性详解\">animation 属性详解</h3><p><code>animation</code> 是 8 个子属性的简写：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子属性</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>关键值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>animation-name</code></td>\n<td>引用 @keyframes 名称</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>animation-duration</code></td>\n<td>单次循环时长</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>animation-timing-function</code></td>\n<td>缓动函数</td>\n<td>同 transition</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>animation-delay</code></td>\n<td>启动延迟</td>\n<td>负值可跳过开头部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>animation-iteration-count</code></td>\n<td>循环次数</td>\n<td><code>infinite</code> 无限循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>animation-direction</code></td>\n<td>播放方向</td>\n<td><code>normal</code>/<code>reverse</code>/<code>alternate</code>/<code>alternate-reverse</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>animation-fill-mode</code></td>\n<td>动画前后的状态</td>\n<td><code>forwards</code>/<code>backwards</code>/<code>both</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>animation-play-state</code></td>\n<td>播放/暂停控制</td>\n<td><code>running</code>/<code>paused</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong><code>animation-fill-mode</code> 是最容易搞错的属性</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>动画开始前</th>\n<th>动画结束后</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>none</code></td>\n<td>初始样式</td>\n<td>初始样式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>forwards</code></td>\n<td>初始样式</td>\n<td>最后关键帧样式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>backwards</code></td>\n<td>第一关键帧样式</td>\n<td>初始样式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>both</code></td>\n<td>第一关键帧样式</td>\n<td>最后关键帧样式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>通常配合 <code>delay</code> 使用 <code>backwards</code> 避免延迟期间显示初始状态的闪烁。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多关键帧的精确控制\">多关键帧的精确控制</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@keyframes pulse {&#10;  0% {&#10;    transform: scale(1);&#10;  }&#10;  50% {&#10;    transform: scale(1.1);&#10;  }&#10;  100% {&#10;    transform: scale(1);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 或用百分比实现弹性效果 */&#10;@keyframes bounce {&#10;  0%,&#10;  100% {&#10;    transform: translateY(0);&#10;    animation-timing-function: ease-in;&#10;  }&#10;  50% {&#10;    transform: translateY(-30px);&#10;    animation-timing-function: ease-out;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> pulse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  0%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  50%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  100%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 或用百分比实现弹性效果 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> bounce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  0%</s